Per-crate third-party license report
================================================================

The exhaustive per-crate breakdown for every Rust dependency in the
production binary — including license text for crates that ship a LICENSE
but no NOTICE — lives at `THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md` at the repo root, and
is shipped inside the production container at `/app/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md`.

That file is generated by `cargo-about` against the `about.toml`
allow-list (which mirrors `deny.toml`'s `[licenses]` allow clause).
Regenerate after a dependency change with:

    make license-report

License compatibility is enforced at CI time by `cargo deny check licenses`
against the same allow-list, so the report and the gate stay in sync.
